WEBVTT

00:00:30.401 --> 00:00:33.821
And what that means for me
is that I am in a constant state

00:00:33.821 --> 00:00:36.908
of thinking about the environment
and climate change.

00:00:37.408 --> 00:00:39.660
And so I want to share
a few things that I know

00:00:39.702 --> 00:00:42.413
and have learned
along the way in my work.

00:00:42.955 --> 00:00:44.165
One is,

00:00:44.165 --> 00:00:48.086
we cannot rely on those
who created the problem to fix it.

00:00:48.836 --> 00:00:52.840
(Applause)

00:00:52.882 --> 00:00:58.679
Two, we need to move with an urgency
that is not happening now.

00:00:59.222 --> 00:01:00.765
And three,